      "Model IDs match the --model flag passed to the codex CLI binary.",
      "Added 2026-11-04: gpt-6-luna ($0.10/$0.50), gpt-6-sol ($2/$10), gpt-6.1-sol ($2/$10), gpt-6.1-terra ($1/$5), standard tier up to 272K input tokens; above 272K the pricing page lists higher rates (stored as long_context_pricing_usd_per_1m). The installed Codex CLI picker lists gpt-6.1-sol, gpt-6-astra, gpt-6.1-terra, gpt-6-sol, gpt-6-luna and the gpt-5.6 family. The pricing page gives no status labels or context windows; context windows come from the CLI's local models cache (gpt-6-luna, gpt-6-sol, gpt-6-astra 272K; gpt-6.1 models 500K).",
      "Capability tiers list the models in the installed Codex CLI picker cache on 2026-11-04 that supersede older ones at equal or lower price; gpt-5.5, gpt-6-sol, gpt-5.6-luna and gpt-5.6-terra stay in `models` and cost_tiers (gpt-5.5 is absent from the picker cache)."
